index/semantic.db
index/semantic.db-wal
index/semantic.db-shm

# Raw external source data (KJV-osis, OSHB, strongs .go files) — large,
# third-party, and license-clean outputs are committed instead in lexicons/.
# PROVENANCE.md (the checksum/pinning record) IS committed.
data/*
!data/PROVENANCE.md
